Up to (currently 3) name servers may be listed, one per  keyword.
If  there are multiple servers, the resolver library queries them
in the order listed.  If no entries are present, the  default  is
to use the name server on the local machine.  (The algorithm used
is  to  try  a  name  server, and if the query times out, try the
next, until out of name servers, then repeat trying all the  name
servers  until  a maximum number of retries are made).  Local do‐
